  dialogueText: {fileID: 1569847720}
  npcIcon: {fileID: 840515505}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1545194912}
  prevButton: {fileID: 536729653}
  skipButton: {fileID: 581501767}
  dialogueSegments:
  - segmentName: Handwashing
    dialogueLines:
    - "If you\u2019re ready, let's kick things off."
    - Before we start, we need to make sure that your hands are clean
    - Now, head to your right, and turn on the faucet to wash your hands.
    - Then, use the soap for a thorough cleaning.
    - Now, remove the bubbles by rinsing off again.
    - Don't forget to dry your hands, use the sterile towel
    - You can throw away the towel inside the bin below the table
    - Now for the final touch, use the sanitizer!
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 252ef468c19195743afb039010e5b1a6, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: f2f7f32632369984ea0e88ff8595e61a, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6450d55bfe50f544fa7de630723cb467, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: fa78b483ab7650649b79f346e8568a94, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: c06add01430e3c746809947cefcdc941, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: a0f75a0f7b576aa4b9450a4b8573cf72, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: f3b6b79ed10e8f847859d17aba3cb6cf, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: f771158379ba3aa4f9ac2b36c42072c9, type: 3}
  - segmentName: GlovesCoat
    dialogueLines:
    - After cleaning your hands, select the gloves to wear them!
    - Check out the lab coats that we have as well and take one.
    - Now you're ready to move on to the vaccines!
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: f2194825c6b63784f8c2e0aa34e54d26, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6cd6f1c634f991745a2a74a494edabaa, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 651cc2a5bb3e21e4ba2c845739438086, type: 3}
  - segmentName: Vaccine Prep
    dialogueLines:
    - Head to the vaccine workstations to see more.
    - Here, you can check on the name of each vial by pointing at them.
    - "For now, we\u2019ll work with DHPP and Sterile Diluent"
    - It's the one with the white DHPP label with a dog icon. Also, we'll mix it
      with the sterile diluent so pick it up as well, and place them on the tray
      on the table.
    - Now, pick up the syringe and draw up the entire liquid from the sterile diluent
      vial.
    - For best practice, we have to replace the needle of our syringe every single
      use.
    - To do that, remove the needle along with the cap and put it in the hazards
      bin.
    - Now, to replace it, take a new needle from the tray on the work station and
      put it on your syringe.
    - "Now we\u2019re ready to mix it."
    - To proceed, mix the sterile diluent inside the vial of DHPP. Since it contains
      powder only, this will allow the liquid to enter.
    - Make sure that you don't pull out the injection right away and gently mix the
      vial by rotating it gently while the syringe is still attached
    - This allows us to avoid clumps, and mix the compounds thoroughly before we
      draw up the mixture again.
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8071e92e7b66a274885ab5779ac2da24, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 94cd40bb66392a24eb786179e271b0ab, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 75c524871643f1948bc8c854a6669e77, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1d8459b2fa19e434e94f40559baf33fb, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: ee967789e1488da4daee057f537474de, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 035e0ca935199224c8ebebd87b922e7f, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 48652619a0aa08f4280c0744386d4d86, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: a1782aa5070054648b5b3c9fd608ee78, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd11d6de40ff75d468c7bee91ffe61b7, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 46bfa1639b1115c4085f6944c9698a3d, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 574d40ab3d0207848bd44e90f5b052da, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: dee66271ae796d34aacc5c1e48e7c36c, type: 3}
  - segmentName: Injection
    dialogueLines:
    - By the way, you should also know that from time to time, and after procedures,
      we should give positive reinforcement to our pups such as treats.
    - This helps prevent trauma for our pups and think that whenever they enter clinics
      like these, all they get is pain.
    - You can get some on our cart and feed it to our pups if you want as it also
      helps ease their nervousness sometimes.
    - Now, just like before, we need to replace the needle first.
    - "Before anything else, you should know that for best practice, we need to check
      our pup\u2019s temperature. To do that, we need to use the Infrared Thermometer."
    - "We have one on the other workstation on the left. Take it and scan our brave
      pup\u2019s temperature"
    - "It seems we can proceed with this. He doesn\u2019t seem to have a fever"
    - To proceed, draw up the vaccine and position yourself where you can easily
      reach for the dog's shoulders.
    - "The best position to insert the needle is at the center of their shoulders
      where there\u2019s a lot of skin so it won\u2019t hurt them too much."
    - Now, try your best to be as gentle as possible to inject it to the designated
      spot of our gentle fur baby.
    - Amazing! You're a natural at this and our fur baby was so brave! It seems he's
      able to relax with you.
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b2083c0e70ac8c4095b21eb4600555d, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0a0ca54766e83f6428d62ac6fc699de9, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: d031711145c3a114382eb266d066d6b3, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: b82b9acedad7717469c8a764309d02f7, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 27d25764e6f1a104690b3fa3ab62dc6f, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3cbe76ba58e6024459cb2ab0bf5bebfb, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52de191ecfd024c4c90cc5d563a108ec, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9e06199ae2e93c442bce7fa7182bdc4a, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9e2d5d60d98e0f540a060c3e586ec030, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8443aa5cee7a5b947b9f852bc5e926c9, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: e0663abfe36fada4d85a4188bfb4642a, type: 3}
  - segmentName: Hallway
    dialogueLines:
    - If you want to explore more, you can now proceed to the next module. The Wound
      Treatment
    - Or if you want, you can also choose a new task and try to administer a different
      vaccine. You can talk to me and choose on the list of vaccines.
    voiceClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: dc0c97378faf66246afbcb09288c715a, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: cecb1061b5411964ab7ee3520b95bc1c, type: 3}
  voiceSource: {fileID: 1493787921}
  audioFolderPath: Audio/Vaccination_StoryMode
  typingSpeed: 0.03
  cutsceneMode: 0
  npcAnimator: {fileID: 512874258}
  isTalkingParam: IsTalking
